   "widgets_values": [
    "# AIOFM Voice \u2014 per girl\n\n**One reference file per girl, forever.** Put 10\u201330s of clean speech in\nComfyUI's input folder and select it in the reference node:\n`emma_voice_ref.wav`, `sofia_voice_ref.wav`, ...\nSame reference every run = same voice every run. That IS her voice.\n\n**Language** is set on the engine node: Norwegian / English / German \u2014\nmatch the script's language, it does not auto-detect reliably.\n\n**Dials** (engine node): `exaggeration` 0.5 default \u2014 raise toward 0.7\nfor more emotion; `cfg_weight` 0.5 \u2014 lower to ~0.3 if pacing sounds\nrushed vs the reference.\n\n**Text under ~21 chars can crash Chatterbox** (known bug \u2014 the suite\npads automatically, but don't feed it one-word scripts).\n\nOutput lands in `output/audio/`. Feed it straight into the talking-head\nworkflow's LoadAudio \u2014 same pod, no round-trip.\nFirst run downloads the Chatterbox Multilingual model automatically."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
